# constraints — Ring-1 stratum: validator-facing bounds, matcher-blind (L-13/F12/F32)
stratum constraints "Constraints as data for VALIDATORS. The matcher never sees these (C8/L-13): @shape, @range and friends route here; the bench emits sidecar stubs pointing at this stratum."

term shape "The @shape attribute key: fixed dimensions, e.g. a 4x4 transform (F12)."
term range "The @range attribute key: an inclusive bound expressed as text, validator-parsed."
term min "The @min attribute key."
term max "The @max attribute key."
term step "The @step attribute key."

record bound "A reified numeric bound, when attribute text is not enough." {
    low : decimal "Inclusive lower bound."
    high : decimal "Inclusive upper bound."
}
